The sprint board is built in `src/` (`main.ts` exports `Model`, `init`, `update` and `view`, with `model.ts`, `message.ts`, `command.ts`, `board.ts` and `view.ts` alongside). `./check` passes and all 26 visible `./test` cases pass; I also drove the main flows (pending moves, declined reverts, add, checklist toggle, archive) in a debug page. I was unsure about a few choices the brief leaves open: titles are trimmed before sending, the rename input keeps its text after a rename, moves into a column that is still loading or has failed are disabled, and a move whose card was moved again before the server answered may revert to a stale position.